        <p class="eyebrow">Collection 02 &middot; 11 photos</p>
        <h1>Golf Days</h1>
        <p class="lead">Corporate and charity golf days shot from the tee box to the green &ndash; fast action, low-angle drama and the small details that tell the story.</p>
        <div class="chips"><a href="#g1">Swings &amp; action <small>2</small></a><a href="#g2">Tee-off &amp; putting <small>6</small></a><a href="#g3">Details <small>3</small></a></div>
    </div>
</section>
<section class="section dark groups">
    <div class="wrap"><section class="group" id="g1">
